249 - Praise Him! Praise Him!
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 249
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[G]Praise Him! praise [Em/B]Him! Jesus, [C]our blessed Redeemer!
[C/G]Sing, O Earth, [G]His wonderful love proclaim!
[G]Hail Him! hail Him! [Em]highest archangels [G]in glory;
[G]Strength and [C]honor give to His holy [G]Name!
[G]Like a shepherd, [C/G]Jesus [Am]will guard His [Bm]children,
[D7/C]In His [Em/B]arms He [F#dim]carries them all day long:

Refrain:
[D/F#]Praise Him! [G]Praise Him! Tell of His excellent greatness.
[G]Praise Him! Praise Him! Ever [Em]in joyful [F#dim]song!

Verse 2:
[G]Praise Him! Praise [Em/B]Him! Jesus, [C]our blessed Redeemer!
[C/G]For our sins [G]He suffered, and bled, and died.
[G]He our Rock, our [Em]hope of eternal [G]salvation,
[G]Hail [C]Him! hail Him! Jesus the [G]Crucified.
[G]Sound His praises! [C/G]Jesus [Am]who bore our [Bm]sorrows,
[D7/C]Love unbounded, [F#dim]wonderful, deep and strong.

Verse 3:
[G]Praise Him! Praise [Em/B]Him! Jesus, [C]our blessed Redeemer!
[C/G]Heavenly portals [G]loud with hosannas ring!
[G]Jesus, Savior, [Em]reigneth forever [G]and ever.
[G]Crown Him! [C]Crown Him! Prophet, and Priest, [G]and King!
[G]Christ is coming! [C/G]over [Am]the world victorious,
[D7/C]Power and [Em/B]glory [F#dim]unto the Lord belong.
